Native Arch userspace package checks: 23/23 PASS

Actual native ELF programs ran in cached Arch Linux userspace with no
network, no capabilities, a read-only root, no-new-privileges, UID65534,
and private tmpfs. Package/ISO/test script were streamed through stdin;
no host directories were mounted and no container image was downloaded.
Arch userspace shares the Debian host Linux kernel; no separate Arch
kernel boot or physical Arch installation is claimed.

All product commands ran with PATH=/no-external-tools. Bash/coreutils/
Docker are external verification infrastructure, not toolkit runtime.
Source ISO and exact toolkit archive remained hash-identical after tests.
